.TH NN-TEST 1 "2026" "nn 0.1.0" "NN Manual"
.SH NAME
nn-test \- run deterministic test vectors
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nn test [options] <model> <tests>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load a directory of npy files or a manifest.json of named inputs/expected outputs.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 all pass; 9 failure.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
nn test model.onnx tests/
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
nn-validate(1), nn-run(1)
